Bundle-Name: Fennec OGC Features Ecore GeoJSON Fragment
Bundle-Description: Fragment of org.eclipse.emf.ecore importing org.geojson, so that a dynamic EPackage \
 (loaded from an .ecore file or a model registry, no generated code) resolves the instance class of \
 its GeoJSON geometry data type. EMF resolves an instance class through the class loader of the \
 package's implementation class, which for a dynamic package is the ecore bundle; without this \
 fragment the geometry data type has no instance class and accepts no value at all.

Fragment-Host: org.eclipse.emf.ecore
Import-Package: org.geojson;version="[1.0,2)"

-resourceonly: true

-buildpath: \
	org.geojson.model;version=latest
